[{"id":"wadhara-6-112-20","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih ostavi!","en":"so leave them!"},{"bs":"i ostavi me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"i ostavljamo","en":"and we leave"},{"bs":"i ostavljate","en":"and you (all) leave"}],"ref":"6:112","answerWord":"فَذَرْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/da6716d78a542de06ab4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus have We appointed unto every prophet an adversary - devils of humankind and jinn who inspire in one another plausible discourse through guile. If thy Lord willed, they would not do so; so leave them alone with their devising;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","جَعَلْنَا","لِكُلِّ","نَبِىٍّ","عَدُوًّا","شَيَٰطِينَ","ٱلْإِنسِ","وَٱلْجِنِّ","يُوحِى","بَعْضُهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","زُخْرُفَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","غُرُورًا","وَلَوْ","شَآءَ","رَبُّكَ","مَا","فَعَلُوهُ","فَذَرْهُمْ","وَمَا","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-6-120-0","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"pa ih ostavi!","en":"so leave them!"},{"bs":"i ostavit će je","en":"and He will leave it"}],"ref":"6:120","answerWord":"وَذَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/dd95ec049a0011336612.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Forsake the outwardness of sin and the inwardness thereof. Lo! those who garner sin will be awarded that which they have earned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَذَرُوا۟","ظَٰهِرَ","ٱلْإِثْمِ","وَبَاطِنَهُۥٓ","إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْسِبُونَ","ٱلْإِثْمَ","سَيُجْزَوْنَ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَقْتَرِفُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-76-27-4","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavljaju","en":"and they leave"},{"bs":"i ostavljate","en":"and you (all) leave"},{"bs":"pa ostavljamo","en":"so we leave"},{"bs":"ostavite nas!","en":"(you all) leave us!"}],"ref":"76:27","answerWord":"وَيَذَرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/8a443d60704b27f734ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! these love fleeting life, and put behind them (the remembrance of) a grievous day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["إِنَّ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","يُحِبُّونَ","ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","وَيَذَرُونَ","وَرَآءَهُمْ","يَوْمًا","ثَقِيلًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-37-125-2","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavljate","en":"and you (all) leave"},{"bs":"pa ostavljamo","en":"so we leave"},{"bs":"i ostavlja ih","en":"and he/it leaves them"},{"bs":"pa ga ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave it!"}],"ref":"37:125","answerWord":"وَتَذَرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/46c7d31cd4f57553966c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Will ye cry unto Baal and forsake the Best of creators,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["أَتَدْعُونَ","بَعْلًا","وَتَذَرُونَ","أَحْسَنَ","ٱلْخَٰلِقِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-6-110-9","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavljamo ih","en":"and we leave them"},{"bs":"i ostavljate","en":"and you (all) leave"},{"bs":"pa me ostavi!","en":"so leave me!"},{"bs":"pa ga ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave it!"}],"ref":"6:110","answerWord":"وَنَذَرُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/b27e6484fa23d8033349.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We confound their hearts and their eyes. As they believed not therein at the first, We let them wander blindly on in their contumacy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَنُقَلِّبُ","أَفْـِٔدَتَهُمْ","وَأَبْصَٰرَهُمْ","كَمَا","لَمْ","يُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِهِۦٓ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَنَذَرُهُمْ","فِى","طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-7-70-5","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavljamo","en":"and we leave"},{"bs":"ostavi Mene!","en":"leave Me!"},{"bs":"pa ih ostavi!","en":"so leave them!"},{"bs":"ostavi nas!","en":"leave us!"}],"ref":"7:70","answerWord":"وَنَذَرَ","answerSound":"audio/cf21a73f43ae717e091e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Hast come unto us that we should serve Allah alone, and forsake what our fathers worshipped? Then bring upon us that wherewith thou threatenest us if thou art of the truthful!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","أَجِئْتَنَا","لِنَعْبُدَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَحْدَهُۥ","وَنَذَرَ","مَا","كَانَ","يَعْبُدُ","ءَابَآؤُنَا","فَأْتِنَا","بِمَا","تَعِدُنَآ","إِن","كُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-7-127-11","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavlja te","en":"and he/it leaves you"},{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"pa me ostavi!","en":"so leave me!"},{"bs":"ostavi nas!","en":"leave us!"}],"ref":"7:127","answerWord":"وَيَذَرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/13aaeb7cac5d9a631b3f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chiefs of Pharaoh's people said: (O King), wilt thou suffer Moses and his people to make mischief in the land, and flout thee and thy gods? He said: We will slay their sons and spare their women, for lo! we are in power over them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","مِن","قَوْمِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","أَتَذَرُ","مُوسَىٰ","وَقَوْمَهُۥ","لِيُفْسِدُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَيَذَرَكَ","وَءَالِهَتَكَ","قَالَ","سَنُقَتِّلُ","أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","وَنَسْتَحْىِۦ","نِسَآءَهُمْ","وَإِنَّا","فَوْقَهُمْ","قَٰهِرُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-7-186-6","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavlja ih","en":"and he/it leaves them"},{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"i ostavit će je","en":"and He will leave it"},{"bs":"pa ih ostavi!","en":"so leave them!"}],"ref":"7:186","answerWord":"وَيَذَرُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ca2abf34765ad45365e5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those whom Allah sendeth astray, there is no guide for them. He leaveth them to wander blindly on in their contumacy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["مَن","يُضْلِلِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَلَا","هَادِىَ","لَهُۥ","وَيَذَرُهُمْ","فِى","طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-9-86-14","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavi nas!","en":"leave us!"},{"bs":"i ostavi me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"pa ga ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave it!"},{"bs":"i ostavljamo ih","en":"and we leave them"}],"ref":"9:86","answerWord":"ذَرْنَا","answerSound":"audio/8042d2cc3bdd7cf6c084.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when a surah is revealed (which saith): Believe in Allah and strive along with His messenger, the men of wealth among them still ask leave of thee and say: Suffer us to be with those who sit (at home).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَإِذَآ","أُنزِلَتْ","سُورَةٌ","أَنْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَجَٰهِدُوا۟","مَعَ","رَسُولِهِ","ٱسْتَـْٔذَنَكَ","أُو۟لُوا۟","ٱلطَّوْلِ","مِنْهُمْ","وَقَالُوا۟","ذَرْنَا","نَكُن","مَّعَ","ٱلْقَٰعِدِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-10-11-10","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ostavljamo","en":"so we leave"},{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"ostavi Mene!","en":"leave Me!"},{"bs":"ostavite nas!","en":"(you all) leave us!"}],"ref":"10:11","answerWord":"فَنَذَرُ","answerSound":"audio/6fd188b9f388f47699c2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If Allah were to hasten on for men the ill (that they have earned) as they would hasten on the good, their respite would already have expired. But We suffer those who look not for the meeting with Us to wander blindly on in their contumacy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","يُعَجِّلُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","ٱلشَّرَّ","ٱسْتِعْجَالَهُم","بِٱلْخَيْرِ","لَقُضِىَ","إِلَيْهِمْ","أَجَلُهُمْ","فَنَذَرُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَرْجُونَ","لِقَآءَنَا","فِى","طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ","يَعْمَهُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-12-47-7","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave it!"},{"bs":"pa je ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave her!"},{"bs":"i ostavi!","en":"and leave!"},{"bs":"i ostavljaju","en":"and they leave"}],"ref":"12:47","answerWord":"فَذَرُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/8dc3e2a52d1a708fc648.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Ye shall sow seven years as usual, but that which ye reap, leave it in the ear, all save a little which ye eat.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["قَالَ","تَزْرَعُونَ","سَبْعَ","سِنِينَ","دَأَبًا","فَمَا","حَصَدتُّمْ","فَذَرُوهُ","فِى","سُنۢبُلِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا","مِّمَّا","تَأْكُلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-19-72-4","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavljamo","en":"and we leave"},{"bs":"i ostavljamo ih","en":"and we leave them"},{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"pa me ostavi!","en":"so leave me!"}],"ref":"19:72","answerWord":"وَّنَذَرُ","answerSound":"audio/5b5baf9dfa993704d1a4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We shall rescue those who kept from evil, and leave the evil-doers crouching there.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","نُنَجِّى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّنَذَرُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","فِيهَا","جِثِيًّا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-20-106-0","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavit će je","en":"and He will leave it"},{"bs":"i ostavlja ih","en":"and he/it leaves them"},{"bs":"ostavite me!","en":"(you all) leave me!"},{"bs":"i ostavljamo","en":"and we leave"}],"ref":"20:106","answerWord":"فَيَذَرُهَا","answerSound":"audio/71cc6eff334d0bb0f485.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And leave it as an empty plain,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["فَيَذَرُهَا","قَاعًا","صَفْصَفًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-40-26-2","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavite me!","en":"(you all) leave me!"},{"bs":"i ostavlja te","en":"and he/it leaves you"},{"bs":"i ostavlja ih","en":"and he/it leaves them"},{"bs":"pa ostavljamo","en":"so we leave"}],"ref":"40:26","answerWord":"ذَرُونِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/17ced988e531e4f9710c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Pharaoh said: Suffer me to kill Moses, and let him cry unto his Lord. Lo! I fear that he will alter your religion or that he will cause confusion in the land.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","فِرْعَوْنُ","ذَرُونِىٓ","أَقْتُلْ","مُوسَىٰ","وَلْيَدْعُ","رَبَّهُۥٓ","إِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","أَن","يُبَدِّلَ","دِينَكُمْ","أَوْ","أَن","يُظْهِرَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ٱلْفَسَادَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-68-44-0","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa me ostavi!","en":"so leave me!"},{"bs":"pa ga ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave it!"},{"bs":"da ostavi","en":"so that he/it may leave"},{"bs":"ostavi ih!","en":"leave them!"}],"ref":"68:44","answerWord":"فَذَرْنِى","answerSound":"audio/6da1df5b18094ac82cce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Leave Me (to deal) with those who give the lie to this pronouncement. We shall lead them on by steps from whence they know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["فَذَرْنِى","وَمَن","يُكَذِّبُ","بِهَٰذَا","ٱلْحَدِيثِ","سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم","مِّنْ","حَيْثُ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-73-11-0","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavi me!","en":"and leave me!"},{"bs":"i ostavlja te","en":"and he/it leaves you"},{"bs":"ostavite me!","en":"(you all) leave me!"},{"bs":"pa ostavljamo","en":"so we leave"}],"ref":"73:11","answerWord":"وَذَرْنِى","answerSound":"audio/cc3fd552133003071372.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Leave Me to deal with the deniers, lords of ease and comfort (in this life); and do thou respite them awhile.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["وَذَرْنِى","وَٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","أُو۟لِى","ٱلنَّعْمَةِ","وَمَهِّلْهُمْ","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}},{"id":"wadhara-74-11-0","words":["verb:wadhara"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavi Mene!","en":"leave Me!"},{"bs":"i ostavite!","en":"and (you all) leave!"},{"bs":"pa je ostavite!","en":"so (you all) leave her!"},{"bs":"i ostavljamo","en":"and we leave"}],"ref":"74:11","answerWord":"ذَرْنِى","answerSound":"audio/02073ad2af0be77f26c2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Leave Me (to deal) with him whom I created lonely,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti, pustiti","en":"to leave, to let be"},"passage":["ذَرْنِى","وَمَنْ","خَلَقْتُ","وَحِيدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَذَرَ"}}]